
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The virtualization landscape changed.<br>The company behind the most popular hypervisor was acquired.<br>The licensing and the agreements changed.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Businesses had to choose: stay &amp; pay &#8211; or escape.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">In this turbulent market new competitors surfaced.<br>New virtualization providers strengthened their position.</p>



